@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001
@missingId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 0A. Health Check - Liveness (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### 0B. Health Check - Readiness (200 OK when Postgres is reachable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### 1. Create Product (201 Created)
# @name createProduct
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: corr-create-001

{
  "name": "Pro Gaming Mousepad",
  "description": "Low-friction micro-woven cloth surface gaming mousepad",
  "sku": "  mp-pro-999  ",
  "price": 39.99,
  "category": "Peripherals"
}

### 2. Create Product - Duplicate SKU (409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Another Mousepad",
  "description": "Trying to reuse the same SKU",
  "sku": "MP-PRO-999",
  "price": 29.99,
  "category": "Peripherals"
}

### 3. Create Product - Validation Error: Empty Name & >2 Decimal Places (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "description": "Invalid product payload",
  "sku": "INVALID-001",
  "price": 19.999,
  "category": "Peripherals"
}

### 4. Get Product by ID (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Product by ID - Not Found (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{missingId}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. List Products - Default Paging (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 7. List Products - Filter by Category, Search, Price Range & Sort (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?search=mousepad&category=Peripherals&minPrice=10&maxPrice=100&sortBy=price&sortDir=asc&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 8. List Products - Invalid Query Parameters (400 Bad Request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?minPrice=200&maxPrice=50&sortBy=invalidField&page=0
Accept: application/json

### 9. Update Product (200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pro Gaming Mousepad XL",
  "description": "Updated XL low-friction gaming mousepad",
  "price": 44.99,
  "category": "Peripherals",
  "version": {{createProduct.response.body.$.version}}
}

### 10. Update Product - Validation Error (400 Bad Request)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pro Gaming Mousepad XL",
  "description": "Negative price test",
  "price": -10.00,
  "category": "Peripherals"
}

### 11. Update Product - Not Found (404 Not Found)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{missingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Non-existent Product",
  "description": "Should return 404",
  "price": 19.99,
  "category": "Peripherals"
}

### 12. Deactivate Product - Soft Delete (204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}

### 13. Deactivate Already-Inactive Product - Idempotent (204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}

### 14. Get Inactive Product - Returns 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Accept: application/json

### 15. Update Inactive Product - Domain Rule Violation (422 Unprocessable Entity, code = product.inactive)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Should Fail With 422",
  "description": "Cannot update an inactive product",
  "price": 49.99,
  "category": "Peripherals"
}

### 16. Activate Product (204 No Content)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}/activate

### 17. Activate Already-Active Product - Idempotent (204 No Content)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}/activate

### 18. Get Reactivated Product (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Accept: application/json

### 19. Monitoring - Prometheus Metrics Scrape Endpoint (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics

### 20. Monitoring - Live Circuit Breaker & Request Telemetry Snapshot (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/monitoring/status
Accept: application/json

